<form id="datadir-form" class="phonetic-form" autocomplete="off" novalidate>
  <div class="phonetic-field">
    <label for="datadir">Bitcoin Core data directory (optional)</label>
    <input id="datadir" placeholder="Leave empty for the default, or e.g. /YOUR/DRIVE" spellcheck="false" autocomplete="off" autocapitalize="off">
  </div>
  <p>Every part of this page that runs <code>bitcoin-cli</code> uses this directory. Leave it empty if you started Bitcoin Core without <code>-datadir</code>.</p>
</form>
